  "voices": {
    "zh": {
      "f3": {
        "先解除绑定、梦境校验和血誓，再分别确认自愿。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-1ed5bb105f6b777b.mp3",
        "爱情不能代签，记忆也不能代签。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-2051869c4b5d59ed.mp3",
        "终止后可能失去力量或部分记忆。不能替本人签同意。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-248c6c20a03116b3.mp3",
        "这是时钟装置的历史原约，不是你的前世证明。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-31684a9345e6fd35.mp3",
        "这里没有任何献祭条款。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-45e348c90eddd0a7.mp3",
        "独立记录与本人姓名重合，形成了记忆锚。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-49760a34a77cda80.mp3",
        "三路同步是底线。可以改变校验先后，不能转移生命代价。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-5889a7d760310350.mp3",
        "缺口能用独立记录核验，不能只靠谁记性好。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-597b352938bce8cd.mp3",
        "进塔前还可以谈边界。救援不会因为你的答案撤回。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-5f26c558255cae27.mp3",
        "第三日验证过：姓名与独立记录可以形成替代锚。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-668ca81ecf8c465e.mp3",
        "只记录你现在愿意留下的约定。以后仍可以改变。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-afb916bf97f415ab.mp3",
        "两边都有队伍，备用电源只能先送一处。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-d36807ba449508d5.mp3",
        "印章只证明材料来源，不代表谁有权支配你。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-e10fe110657de4cf.mp3",
        "它放在结界外，再由保管人带回。不是所有地方都倒流。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-ea5b82051a1a4c7d.mp3",
        "撤销权属于当前启用者，不由旧承诺代签。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f3-ff019a43cb806dc0.mp3"
      },
      "f4": {
        "撤销之后，城市不会再听我指挥。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-00e6772796b10266.mp3",
        "停机后，我不能保证所有人继续服从。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-138caeda008c5a6e.mp3",
        "第七日，你会以第一百位新娘的身份戴冠。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-2413bff3dbee62bc.mp3",
        "你们仍可以停下来。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-28522e16cdf08604.mp3",
        "你们要带走副本，就留下完整的交接记录。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-4909a5dc1aacf166.mp3",
        "原始记录在红色档案室，访问方式须登记。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-54647acf1ca01a27.mp3",
        "保留循环，你可以继续拥有那些记忆。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-6128d6423d369719.mp3",
        "你可以先看记录，再告诉我你的要求。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-71ef87836f851b6b.mp3",
        "我宁可让城市重复，也不愿失去控制。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-8dcddfe543f6c130.mp3",
        "没有守护者，明天会怎样？": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-f4-dab44fb6357b753b.mp3"
      },
      "m1": {
        "同样的七天，我记得九十九遍。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-04c42d4f68749df0.mp3",
        "我不是靠强大活到现在，是被它不断重新启动。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-05803f938a292efe.mp3",
        "他的梦可能受时钟影响，不能直接当证词。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-0f69b55d3ab6dcc3.mp3",
        "封印出自议会。签名还不能确认。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-13256fa8cd0bae4d.mp3",
        "这份录音，我以前没有听过。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-154de8edfb56d6e8.mp3",
        "我的绑定，我自己同意解除。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-2fce1ae3323d950a.mp3",
        "它会放出片段。片段不等于完整事实。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-40248ee5b574698b.mp3",
        "周五午夜前，别独自去那座天台。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-405f0a94a7fc8bec.mp3",
        "这枚印章需要核验。不能因为我不喜欢他们，就认定他们有罪。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-41814cb4ce73cc0d.mp3",
        "你还活着。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-478e82b82da2037a.mp3",
        "你不必记得那些片段，才有资格拒绝我。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-51b4587d46e4f116.mp3",
        "我需要帮助，但你没有替我承担的义务。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-56e879a4c93cd39e.mp3",
        "那是控制，不是保护。我不能用害怕为它开脱。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-5babb5aff6f4ffb3.mp3",
        "这次恢复没有发生死亡。把过程留下。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-673b6705bbb8a129.mp3",
        "两个街区被吞掉，死亡仍发生了。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-69e95d68e61a4cf4.mp3",
        "我能提供记录。你不必只听我的话。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-7156c229f011d580.mp3",
        "那次我死了。重置把我带回来，没有带走记忆。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-85bce2e7a96875f0.mp3",
        "这一次，你第一次带回了死亡的片段。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-86d32fc6da5d7e4b.mp3",
        "我爱的是现在的你，不只是我记得的那些片段。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-8eac637d836bf7f6.mp3",
        "我愿意讲快乐的片段，也愿意接受你只谈证据。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-913549c50836b7ba.mp3",
        "第五十四次，我把你锁在屋里，以为能避开天台。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-94dd25f86fec3597.mp3",
        "不死，和真正活着，不是一回事。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-ab751c9cc3520ee1.mp3",
        "以前我会自己拿走它。这次不。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-b1b4374bf9f71048.mp3",
        "如果你愿意，我们可以从第一次约会重新开始。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-b1c33514307f66a3.mp3",
        "那段关系不是你现在必须继续的关系。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-b4e287baf053a027.mp3",
        "我后来才加入。我没有见过这份原始附页。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-b5513ca26e97ac95.mp3",
        "你的入场记录，不是同意戴冠的记录。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-b5861010b7b31145.mp3",
        "不是九十九个世纪，是九十九次没能结束的一周。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-be882976b893d4f1.mp3",
        "解除的是对时间的控制，不是谁的生命。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-c38ebd9ecc4c319b.mp3",
        "我记得午夜时钟响起，她在我怀里停止呼吸。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-cc52c861191b3a49.mp3",
        "我能感觉到太阳的暖意。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-e07de441a8c191dc.mp3",
        "那次我们曾亲近。你后来要求我不要替你决定。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-e0a4a4af8718a698.mp3",
        "你可以关心，也可以只谈怎么解除绑定。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-e51dec46cc734205.mp3",
        "看着我。跟着我的声音。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-faf211937c9b5cc8.mp3",
        "我记得，不等于我有权替你决定。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m1-fd11d899bae02f49.mp3"
      },
      "m3": {
        "海边的邀请没有附带关系条件。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-0379dac1b77ca27c.mp3",
        "裂缝扩大了。我不能把恐惧写成医疗判断。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-1957375a5c0c8728.mp3",
        "生命体征稳定。之后还会复查，不只看这一刻。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-3af7fd40a7612923.mp3",
        "先后顺序由资源决定，不由你喜欢谁决定。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-4328fd641e663794.mp3",
        "所以我保留检查和签收记录，不替梦下结论。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-4557989ad206a277.mp3",
        "我的风险由我确认，不转给别人。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-5b5eda8890d4c36d.mp3",
        "门还能撑六分钟。楼梯通向外面的临时诊区。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-6c9a2f065abf939a.mp3",
        "我梦见心跳恢复。梦里没有日期。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-8036987a0fa2fead.mp3",
        "救援不能等。见证程序也不能省。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-884e1940c92cf6ab.mp3",
        "这次先听当事人的话，再决定怎么救。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-92100a6224ab439f.mp3",
        "不是你的命在供电。是这些名字在回应。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-936c8e220c28a322.mp3",
        "风险要复核，医疗支持也要到场。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-968092f2e8db7fab.mp3",
        "出口还能走。证物袋在桌上，担架在我这里。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-9cd7b8a2621cc8bc.mp3",
        "医院需要连续供电。人工通气可以短时接上。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-a5ca1886627ce094.mp3",
        "我把异常患者留在医院，以为封门就能保护别人。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-dc0e3f21e1e043b9.mp3",
        "不决定恋爱，也是一份完整的未来。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-e0e41a26e376544e.mp3",
        "接下来谁留下，由你决定。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-e6167275eaaa6a0a.mp3",
        "可以检查吗？你随时可以叫停。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-e674b7972a936087.mp3",
        "三路都准备好，医疗备用也在。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-ee3a1a9f66b25755.mp3",
        "从九十七这个数字出现后，我就一直梦见这里。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-f4173cb4e6f3f32a.mp3",
        "人还在。我们先让记录也留下。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-f50a5c0db891ac4f.mp3",
        "我想有未来。但你不欠我那个未来。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-f6947bbb667f6cf9.mp3",
        "安娜·莫拉莱斯。她一直记得自己喜欢天文学。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-fbf617f4c3c498b7.mp3",
        "电子病历里，一个都没有了。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m3-fecf7176b8c7d75f.mp3"
      },
      "m4": {
        "我签自己的，不替别人签。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-1a023582b8e26ef2.mp3",
        "等你的方案确认，再同时执行。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-1a3c75da08dcf74f.mp3",
        "我执行了命令，没有核对受伤的是谁。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-23d8b99da2c92c74.mp3",
        "我检查了两遍。时钟没有重启。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-26e8d4706d34b716.mp3",
        "那就继续查，不替空白填名字。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-35d4a09467835d3a.mp3",
        "我的片段里有假面。我无法证明是谁戴着它。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-38f8a3e2f29a1830.mp3",
        "重建猎人团需要见证人，不需要谁成为谁的所有物。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-48eef470db5e90b7.mp3",
        "南隧道要排水。北侧干通道也能绕行，但更慢。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-6584d243577a433e.mp3",
        "你可以不原谅。两版记录都给你。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-6df4c73efa75a55e.mp3",
        "自由不是我们救城之后，才赏给你的东西。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-819fa3565079cd9a.mp3",
        "我没有核对两版，就执行了。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-92dab4776441fd70.mp3",
        "记忆不完整不是免责。原始命令在团部。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-9d293e0f7d133637.mp3",
        "不再执行来路不明的命令。证据不齐，就停。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-a0e450cbb84defbc.mp3",
        "血誓不能代替今天的同意。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-a4b5fc3d56ad2fe5.mp3",
        "别因为我受伤，就把判断交给我。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-b5b93cdba7cdf796.mp3",
        "即使你独自走，我也会继续反对那座时钟。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-d5c9fe9fe09c5afe.mp3",
        "第七十六次，我执行过针对你的命令。": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/zh-m4-e797bc89396b5f2f.mp3"
      }
    },
    "en": {
      "f3": {
        "You may still state your boundaries before the tower. Rescue will not be withdrawn for your answer.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-26d0cae136017b35.mp3",
        "First release the binding, dream validation, and blood oath; then confirm voluntary participation separately.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-30f667424c11e2c9.mp3",
        "The seals establish provenance. They grant no authority over you.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-38f8311b118c83ab.mp3",
        "It is stored outside the boundary and carried back by custodians. Time does not reverse everywhere.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-4e5d9e09294fb44d.mp3",
        "Three-way synchronization is essential. We can reorder checks, not transfer a cost in lives.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-53456e03c023e917.mp3",
        "Ending them may cost power or some memories. Consent cannot be signed by someone else.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-66db08ae3f179c4f.mp3",
        "There is no sacrificial clause here.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-7292f356719e8bfc.mp3",
        "This is the clock’s historical charter, not proof of a previous incarnation.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-82dc18849fc8ca8c.mp3",
        "We record only the agreements you want now. They may still change later.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-8577c0f24c0a2ef7.mp3",
        "We can verify gaps with independent records, not someone’s confidence in their memory.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-a42f48c063a18650.mp3",
        "Independent records matched with personal names form a memory anchor.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-b08e3c9514c112dd.mp3",
        "Love cannot sign for you. Neither can memory.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-b2155d25ba46cb66.mp3",
        "We verified it on day three: names matched with independent records can form an alternative anchor.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-c5047462ce1218a9.mp3",
        "Both have teams. The backup generator can reach only one first.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-c5ed3d4e5f59e793.mp3",
        "Revocation belongs to the current operator. An old promise cannot sign for them.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f3-fbf4063cc3b3a4a1.mp3"
      },
      "f4": {
        "You may inspect the records before stating your terms.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-1d4e9bd4c335ddce.mp3",
        "I would rather repeat the city than lose control of it.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-3725362c6496123f.mp3",
        "Keep the loop, and you can keep those memories.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-68025ce2e67f1b0b.mp3",
        "If you take copies, leave a complete handover record.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-6a49b4e1969062d5.mp3",
        "The original records are in the red archive. Access must be registered.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-830f18b5928e5eee.mp3",
        "After shutdown, I cannot guarantee everyone will keep obeying.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-b12a273fc9cc02fc.mp3",
        "Without a keeper, what will tomorrow be?": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-b3cffc12e3dcf71f.mp3",
        "After revocation, the city will no longer answer to me.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-b4d9d0d23fa79905.mp3",
        "You can still stop.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-ca2f5a293d88e5c7.mp3",
        "On the seventh day, you will wear the crown as the hundredth bride.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-f4-dc1abdc9a2a90f58.mp3"
      },
      "m1": {
        "You’re alive.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-06b5a06fb5a317cc.mp3",
        "You do not need to remember those fragments to have the right to refuse me.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-152813a42998c66c.mp3",
        "Remembering does not give me the right to decide for you.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-207fc2cf0541e8c4.mp3",
        "I can feel the warmth of the sun.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-2f7a39a3d6620f9a.mp3",
        "The same seven days. I remember ninety-nine of them.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-41a62f5e21e95faa.mp3",
        "That relationship is not one you are required to continue now.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-42788ac06216ad62.mp3",
        "If you wish, we can begin again with a first date.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-4b6d634c2bd5f88b.mp3",
        "Immortality is not the same as living.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-54f3b13d1c91637b.mp3",
        "I can give you records. You need not take my word for it.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-56dde9577b268648.mp3",
        "Your entry record is not consent to wear the crown.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-56e6893ca8917f13.mp3",
        "Look at me. Stay with my voice.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-581ae9b6355aa7f6.mp3",
        "His dreams may be affected by the clock. They are not testimony by themselves.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-5883d2b4967fe508.mp3",
        "I can tell you the happier fragments, or we can discuss only evidence.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-5e9b586eeb634c5d.mp3",
        "Two blocks were erased. The death still happened.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-720ca024b4d4111f.mp3",
        "I died that time. The reset brought me back without taking the memory.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-7837cfe63fb25753.mp3",
        "I have never heard this recording before.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-7f1443624a7da262.mp3",
        "That stamp needs checking. My dislike is not proof of guilt.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-816170cedefc99d2.mp3",
        "Strength did not keep me alive. It kept restarting me.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-841e602276593230.mp3",
        "The seal comes from the council. The signature is not yet confirmed.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-853a6a5bf67f0aca.mp3",
        "That was control, not protection. Fear does not excuse it.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-90fdc4ba21826987.mp3",
        "I love you now, not only the fragments I remember.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-b9860a5ea1b74528.mp3",
        "In cycle fifty-four, I locked you inside, thinking it would keep you from the rooftop.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-c106b2d9d3d7e98a.mp3",
        "I consent to release my binding.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-ceabadefed485fa2.mp3",
        "This is the first time you have brought back a fragment of dying.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-d059b36ada65a263.mp3",
        "We release control of time, not anyone’s life.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-d11f2cf412c0cf58.mp3",
        "No one died for this restoration. Preserve the procedure.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-d3028384b9c5b32c.mp3",
        "Before, I would have taken it away myself. Not this time.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-d31490a764dd15d8.mp3",
        "We were close then. Later, you asked me not to decide for you.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-d89407c392ca20ce.mp3",
        "You may care, or we can discuss only how to end the binding.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-db8e1b73f9dd8e33.mp3",
        "I joined later. I had never seen this original addendum.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-deaaf06e967b7a35.mp3",
        "Before midnight on Friday, do not go to that rooftop alone.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-e0cf66cb33f2308b.mp3",
        "I remember the midnight bell and her breath stopping in my arms.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-ec3b07f2b707f1a8.mp3",
        "Not ninety-nine centuries. Ninety-nine weeks that could not end.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-f57c9e3f5b05ba55.mp3",
        "It releases fragments. Fragments are not the whole truth.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-f8c0f2f422f15af3.mp3",
        "I need help. You are not obliged to bear the risk for me.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m1-fa2ba5804ca6411a.mp3"
      },
      "m3": {
        "You decide who stays for the next step.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-179785a5135f7d41.mp3",
        "That is why I keep examination and custody records, not conclusions about dreams.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-2c15c60e52d65bde.mp3",
        "Your life is not powering this. The names are responding.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-3f38af57b273bea7.mp3",
        "A future without a romantic decision is still complete.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-4344bba47e9646b9.mp3",
        "Ana Morales. She still remembers that she loves astronomy.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-48382afd2a402884.mp3",
        "All three channels are ready, with medical backup.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-485cd94401efb409.mp3",
        "The people are still here. We need their records to stay, too.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-50c44b61fbe2d231.mp3",
        "The breach spread. I cannot call fear a medical judgment.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-59cf9db3cea58457.mp3",
        "I confirm my own risk. It will not be transferred to someone else.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-5a27eac2b9cc8c92.mp3",
        "The invitation to the coast comes with no relationship conditions.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-5cb9473fbdafecf5.mp3",
        "None of them remain in the electronic records.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-6b8307e5ff6d5a05.mp3",
        "The hospital needs continuous power. Manual ventilation can bridge a short gap.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-6df4191b6dbe0862.mp3",
        "I want a future. You do not owe me that future.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-791ae0ec4d740c1c.mp3",
        "The risks need review, and medical support must be present.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-88ef9afec2387eff.mp3",
        "This time, we listen to the people affected before deciding how to help.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-8919db725bcf14ed.mp3",
        "The door can hold for six minutes. The stairs lead to the outdoor triage area.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-a22b641acd50a9d4.mp3",
        "Since the number ninety-seven began appearing, I keep dreaming of this place.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-a4ae1d041da05dae.mp3",
        "May I examine it? You can stop me at any point.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-a607974c3b0ec038.mp3",
        "I dreamed of a heartbeat returning. The dream had no date.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-c3183942df06e2d1.mp3",
        "Resource allocation is not a test of whom you love.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-d23fa571338fd2cf.mp3",
        "The exit is usable. The evidence pouch is on the desk; I have the stretcher.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-e0e4984278c481c9.mp3",
        "I kept anomalous patients inside, believing a locked door would protect everyone else.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-e66ee73234ccc82f.mp3",
        "Rescue cannot wait. Neither can the witness procedure be skipped.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-f088c9bb069615d0.mp3",
        "Your vital signs are stable. We will check again, not rely on one moment.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m3-ff40be909f9edcf0.mp3"
      },
      "m4": {
        "Even if you walk alone, I will still stand against that clock.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-0e856c8b2af4f3c1.mp3",
        "The blood oath cannot replace consent today.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-1aa3bf8ecc7bfb47.mp3",
        "You need not forgive me. Both versions are yours to examine.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-1c51b0ce740ffe7a.mp3",
        "My fragment contains a mask. I cannot prove who wore it.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-1d972f76daf31c00.mp3",
        "I carried out an order without checking who would be harmed.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-21d9939f5d6ca28e.mp3",
        "Rebuilding the hunters needs witnesses, not anyone belonging to anyone.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-24cc359b2bcc8f1a.mp3",
        "Do not let my injury make the decision for you.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-308c4908dd7247c3.mp3",
        "Freedom is not something we award you for helping save the city.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-329f4a2f0dfa228b.mp3",
        "I checked twice. The clock did not restart.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-38be08c77733461d.mp3",
        "The south tunnel needs pumping. The dry north passage works, but takes longer.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-4fb9419c589548a3.mp3",
        "We execute together after your plan is confirmed.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-657fe6f10f22b797.mp3",
        "In cycle seventy-six, I carried out an order against you.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-8a1dbcf9d9b46dfc.mp3",
        "Missing memories do not excuse me. The original order is at headquarters.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-b55a1fd5cd16fe6e.mp3",
        "Then we keep checking. We do not invent a name for a blank.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-bfa5283be44746f4.mp3",
        "I sign for myself, not for anyone else.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-c0e242a961d4771a.mp3",
        "No more orders of uncertain origin. If evidence is missing, we stop.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-c998f544d48ba30b.mp3",
        "I acted without comparing the two versions.": "art/official/m111-v2/voice/en-m4-e601ab1cf3d82102.mp3"
      }
    }
  },
